    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Wondrous Item, Uncommon (Requires Attunement)</em></p><p>A battlefield chirurgeon sold it upon retiring, swearing that in thirty years of war she never lost a patient who wore it.</p><p>While wearing this pendant, you gain the following benefits.</p><p><em><strong>Life Preservation.</strong></em> Whenever you make a Death Saving Throw, you can change a roll of 9 or lower to a 10, turning a failed save into a successful one.</p><p><em><strong>Natural Healing Boost.</strong></em> Whenever you roll a Hit Point Die to regain Hit Points, double the number of Hit Points it restores.</p>",
